  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Take Environmental Education to the Next Level!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2022-2023 school year will mark our fourth year of Environmental Education at the Los Algarrobos School. This year, we have created a new position &quot;Environmental Education Coordinator&quot; to take the program to new heights! Jenn, native of Alaska is taking charge and including more activities, topics and workshops than ever before. With her help, we will also be able to take these activities beyond the classrooms at Los Algarrobos and include members of the greater community.</narrative>
  </description>
